  - key: PAYTABLE_SCATTER_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: <b><size=24>3 <style=coinColor> 2 x Total Bet</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SPECIAL_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_FREE_GAMES
    value: <style=title><size=42>PIGGY WHEEL BONUS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_FREE_GAMES_12
    value: '<size=22>Scatter appears on reels 1, 3 and 5 only.

      3 Scatters triggers Free Games.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_FREE_GAMES_1
    value: '<size=24>- Wild is sticky during Free Games and appears on reels 2 and
      4 only.

      - Wild remains locked until end of Free Games.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_FREE_GAMES_2
    value: "<size=24>Free Games is triggered by receiving 3 Scatters in Base Game,
      or winning the Free Games wedge on the Piggy Wheel Bonus.\r\nAward 10 Free Spins
      when Free Games triggered.\r\n3 Scatters during Free Games awards 10 additional
      Free Spins.\r\nPiggy Wheel Bonus may be triggered during Free Games. If Free
      Games wedge is won, then award 10 additional Free Spins.\r\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_JACKPOTS
    value: <style=title><size=42>GRAND & MEGA JACKPOTS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_JACKPOTS
    value: '<size=24>- Each spin provides the user an opportunity to win the Jackpot.

      - After each spin, either a GRAND or MEGA JACKPOT may be awarded.

      - Jackpots are available for qualifying bets only.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>50 LINES</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Bet Per Line: 1</color></size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><size=42>LINES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_11
    value: "<size=22>3 or more Scatters \ntriggers Free Games"
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_0
    value: <size=20>Wild substitutes for all symbols except Scatter.
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_1
    value: "<size=21>- Piggy Wilds Bonus is triggered at random during Base and Free
      Games. \r\n- When triggered, Golden Piggy scatters Wild Symbols onto the reel
      set.\r\n- After reels stop, any spot with Scatter behind the added Wild becomes
      Wild & Bonus symbol. \r\n- Wild & Bonus symbol is both a Wild and Scatter. \r\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_2
    value: "<size=21>-          appears as sub-symbols on the reels. \n- Every           that
      appears may randomly trigger the Piggy Wheel Bonus.\n- The more            there
      appears on the reels, the greater the chance to trigger\n   the Piggy Wheel
      Bonus.\n- Player may win a Coin Prize, Coin Pick Bonus or Free Games on the
      vertical Piggy Wheel spin."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2_1
    value: '<style=title><size=32>PIGGY WILDS BONUS

'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2_2
    value: <style=title><size=32>PIGGY WHEEL BONUS
  - key: CONTENTS_GAME_TITLE
    value: Golden Piggy
  - key: RESPIN_SYMBOL_CREDIT
    value: '{0:SimpleNumber}'
  - key: COIN_PRIZE_CREDIT
    value: '{0:SimpleNumber}'
  - key: COIN_PICK_CREDIT
    value: '{0}'
  - key: GOP_COIN_PICK_RESULT_CREDIT
    value: '{0:CommaNumber}'
  - key: GOP_COIN_PICK_JACKPOT_0
    value: MINI JACKPOT WIN +
  - key: GOP_COIN_PICK_JACKPOT_1
    value: MAJOR JACKPOT WIN +
  - key: GOP_COIN_PICK_JACKPOT_2
    value: MEGA JACKPOT WIN +
  - key: GOP_COIN_PICK_JACKPOT_3
    value: GRAND JACKPOT WIN +
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_1
    value: "<size=20>- The Coin Pick Bonus has 30 coins as pick items.\r\n- Picked
      coins will reward either a Credit or the Piggy Bank.\r\n- Receiving Credits
      will increase the gauge on left by the same amount.\r\n- Receiving Piggy Bank
      ends the Coin Pick Bonus.\r\n- After Bonus ends, award the user's bet multiplied
      by the amount on the gauge.\r\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_2
    value: "<size=20>- Depending on the amount on the gauge, award Mini, Major, Mega
      or Grand\n   Jackpot.\r\n- Only the greatest Jackpot is awarded among the claimable
      Jackpots.\r\n- If gauge reaches Grand Jackpot, then award Grand Jackpot amount
      only and\n   end the Bonus. \r"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_COIN_PICK
    value: "<style=title><size=32>Coin Pick Bonus\r\n</size></style>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_JACKPOT
    value: <style=title><size=32>JACKPOT</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4_1
    value: "<size=20>- Free Games is triggered by receiving 3 Scatters in Base Game,
      or winning theFree Games wedge\n   on the Piggy Wheel Bonus.\r\n- Award 10 Free
      Spins when Free Games triggered.\r\n- 3 Scatters during Free Games awards 10
      additional Free Spins.\r\n- Piggy Wheel Bonus may be triggered during Free Games.
      If Free Games wedge is won, then award\n 10 additional Free Spins.\r\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_4_1
    value: <style=title><size=32>FREE GAMES
